  "readmeFile": "README-SQLSERVER.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This is an actively maintained fork of the EntitySpaces ORM, built on the original architecture. This release modernizes the runtime for .NET Framework 4.8, .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10.&#10;&#10;• Thread‑safe parameter cache using ConcurrentDictionary (eliminates lock contention).&#10;• Safe connection pool management with automatic rollback on errors (prevents connection leaks).&#10;• Automatic concurrency exception detection and translation.&#10;&#10;SQL Server specific improvements:&#10;• Optimized OUTPUT INSERTED for computed, concurrency (rowversion/timestamp), and default columns (single round‑trip).&#10;• SET XACT_ABORT ON for immediate rollback on any runtime error.&#10;• Automatic server version detection (cached per connection string).&#10;• Full concurrency exception translation covering 532, 547, 1205, 1222, 2601, and 2627.&#10;• Modernized with Microsoft.Data.SqlClient (compatible with SQL Server 2016–2025 and Azure SQL).",
